hy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/IMG_0212.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/IMG_0212-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/IMG_0212-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/IMG_0212-1024x768.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/i2.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/IMG_0213.jpg?fit=700%2C525&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5323\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=5323\" class=\"wp-image-5323\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/IMG_0213.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/IMG_0213-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/IMG_0213-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/IMG_0213-1024x768.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/i1.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/IMG_0214.jpg?fit=700%2C525&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5324\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=5324\" class=\"wp-image-5324\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/IMG_0214.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/IMG_0214-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/IMG_0214-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/IMG_0214-1024x768.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/i2.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/IMG_0216.jpg?fit=700%2C525&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5325\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=5325\" class=\"wp-image-5325\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/IMG_0216.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/IMG_0216-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/IMG_0216-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/IMG_0216-1024x768.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/i1.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/IMG_0217.jpg?fit=700%2C525&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5326\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=5326\" class=\"wp-image-5326\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/IMG_0217.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/IMG_0217-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/IMG_0217-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/IMG_0217-1024x768.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/IMG_0218.jpg?fit=700%2C525&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5327\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=5327\" class=\"wp-image-5327\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/IMG_0218.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/IMG_0218-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/IMG_0218-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/IMG_0218-1024x768.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/i2.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/IMG_0219.jpg?fit=700%2C525&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5328\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=5328\" class=\"wp-image-5328\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/IMG_0219.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/IMG_0219-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/IMG_0219-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/IMG_0219-1024x768.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/figure><\/li><\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p>There&#8217;s so much to see &#8230; even though we&#8217;re not hikers.  And there&#8217;s many other types of cactus growing in this region besides the Saguaro.  Some of it is even flowering now in the midst of winter when generally this happens in the spring.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>We then drove on down the road a bit to the Arizona-Sonoran Desert Museum.  But as it turned out, the entrance fee was $25 each and we were already half way through the day.  We decided that for that price we had better come back another day to be able to take advantage of all the museum has to offer.  We&#8217;ve heard lots of great comments from friends who have been there and want to be able to get our money&#8217;s worth.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>But if you just can&#8217;t wait for our post about the museum, <a rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" aria-label=\"here's a link to their web site to find out more. (opens in a new tab)\" href=\"https:\/\/www.desertmuseum.org\/about\/\" target=\"_blank\">here&#8217;s a link to their web site to find out more.<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Lunch is always a highlight of my day and this one was no exception.  At the south end of the park trail is a nice little cafe called &#8220;Coyote Pause Cafe&#8221;.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-3 is-cropped wp-block-gallery-2 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/i1.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181226_130733.jpg?fit=700%2C394&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5330\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=5330\" class=\"wp-image-5330\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181226_130733.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181226_130733-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181226_130733-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181226_130733-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181226_130745.jpg?fit=700%2C394&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5331\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=5331\" class=\"wp-image-5331\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181226_130745.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181226_130745-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181226_130745-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181226_130745-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181226_131113.jpg?fit=700%2C394&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5332\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=5332\" class=\"wp-image-5332\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181226_131113.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181226_131113-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181226_131113-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181226_131113-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/i1.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181226_133636.jpg?fit=700%2C394&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5333\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=5333\" class=\"wp-image-5333\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181226_133636.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181226_133636-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181226_133636-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181226_133636-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181226_133819.jpg?fit=700%2C394&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5334\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=5334\" class=\"wp-image-5334\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181226_133819.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181226_133819-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181226_133819-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181226_133819-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/i1.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181226_135444.jpg?fit=700%2C394&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5335\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=5335\" class=\"wp-image-5335\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181226_135444.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181226_135444-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181226_135444-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181226_135444-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/i2.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181226_135512.jpg?fit=700%2C394&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5336\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=5336\" class=\"wp-image-5336\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181226_135512.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181226_135512-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181226_135512-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181226_135512-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/figure><\/li><\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p>After a late lunch we moved on down the road a little further to the International Wildlife Museum on Gates Pass Road.  Although this museum costs only $7 each to get in, it was getting into mid-afternoon and we wanted to hit the road (I-10) before the Tucson rush hour traffic.  <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>We&#8217;ll come back another day here too.  But at least now we know what we want to see and where it is.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Thanks for coming along and be sure to sign up to get our future blog posts automatically by entering your email address in the little box on the left side where it says \u201cSign Up To Follow Our Blog\u201d.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>You can check out all our RV full-time travel videos at herbnkathyrv on You Tube and click SUBSCRIBE down in the lower right corner of any of our videos.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>The Saguaro Cactus (pronounced Sawarro) is the largest of the cactus family and can live to be 150-200 years old. These are found in The Sonoran Desert of Arizona and Mexico and occasionally in southern California. These cactus have one tap root that only goes down about 2 feet or so and other roots that &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2019\/01\/03\/the-magnificent-saguaro-cactus\/\" class=\"more-link\">Continue reading <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">The Magnificent Saguaro Cactus<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[586,19546],"tags":[24592,198641,554707279,554707661,554707660,23317,3559,457967,554707623],"class_list":["post-5296","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-food","category-sightseeing","tag-arizona","tag-cactus","tag-desert","tag-herbnkathyrv","tag-herbsells","tag-museum","tag-rv","tag-saguaro","tag-sonoran"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5296","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?p